# Agent notes — {{repo_name}}

Consolidated learnings from working in this repo. **Not loaded every session.**
Read it when starting on an unfamiliar area, when something behaves
surprisingly, or before promoting an entry into {{instruction_file}}.

Raw material (session transcripts, CI output, git history) is not copied here —
only what survived being understood. One entry per pattern.

Appending during a task is half the loop. The other half is `{{consolidate_command}}`:
merge duplicate entries, re-verify each entry's cited code location against
current code, mark what no longer holds as superseded, and propose promotions
into {{instruction_file}}. Without that pass this file rots into an append-only
pile that agents trust anyway. Promotions are proposed for a human to accept.

